mdkg:SA-004 a mdcore:SubstitutionAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Replace a single parallel key with two keys where the hub length limits key length"@en ;
    mdcore:analystNote "A frequently made and rarely justified assumption is that two keys each carry half the torque. Neither cited source says so. The assessment records the gap instead of assuming equal sharing."@en ;
