    ev:extractionMethod "analyst-curated-from-source-page, anchor-verified against PDF" ;
    ev:fromSourceDocument mott6:document ;
    ev:normalizedStatement "Mott states that the SAE spline permanent fit A is used when the mating part is not to be moved after installation, fit B when the mating part will be moved along the shaft without a torque load, and fit C when the mating part must be moved under load; the spline depth h and minor diameter d differ between the fits."@en ;
    ev:supportedByEvidence mott6:es-0049 ;
    ev:textIntegrity "reliable" .

