    ev:blockIdentifier "mott6/p499/b20" ;
    ev:boundingBox "62.98,471.36,305.91,555.4" ;
    ev:extractedText "Using a steel ring compressed tightly around a smooth shaft allows torque to be transmitted between the hub of a power-transmitting element and a shaft without having a key between the two elements. Figure 11–10 shows a commercially available product called a Locking Assembly™ from Ringfeder® Corporation that employs this principle."@en ;
